 "doc": "//! 🥣️ Companion tests of value: retirement integration, refusal codecs, typed values, paged and shared text, leases, bounded and retained cloning.\n//!\n//! 🧭️ The root laws are mounted flat; the laws of each value module sit below a wrapper of that module that restates its imports and uses the crate's `testkit` hooks.",
